					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Universal method: 
1. In the omnibox (address bar) type chrome://policy 
2. If BrowserGuestModeEnabled is not displayed under the Policy Name column or it is not set to 0 under the Policy Value column, this is a finding.

Windows method:
1. Start regedit
2. Navigate to HKLM\Software\Policies\Google\Chrome\
3. If the BrowserGuestModeEnabled value name does not exist or its value data is not set to 0, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
