					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Set the policy value for Computer Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft Office 2016 (Machine) -&gt; Security Settings -&gt; IE Security "Navigate URL" to "Enabled" and place a check in the 'onent.exe' check box.
</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
