					<SID_NAME>description</SID_NAME>
					<SID_DATA>The Microsoft PowerPoint 2016 Security Technical Implementation Guide (STIG) is published as a tool to improve the security of Department of Defense (DoD) information systems.  Comments or proposed revisions to this document should be sent via e-mail to the following address: disa.stig_spt@mail.mil.</SID_DATA>
