					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft PowerPoint 2016 -&gt; PowerPoint Options -&gt; Save "default file format" is set to "Enabled: PowerPoint Presentation (*.pptx)".

Procedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: 

HKCU\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Office\16.0\PowerPoint\options 

Criteria: If the value DefaultFormat is REG_DWORD = 1b (hex) or 27 (decimal), this is not a finding.
</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Set the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft PowerPoint 2016 -&gt; PowerPoint Options -&gt; Save "default file format" to "Enabled: PowerPoint Presentation (*.pptx)".
