					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft PowerPoint 2016 -&gt; PowerPoint Options -&gt; Security -&gt; Trust Center -&gt; Protected View "Open files on local Intranet UNC in Protected View" is set to "Enabled".

Procedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: 

HKCU\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Office\16.0\PowerPoint\security\protectedview

Criteria: If the value DisableIntranetCheck is REG_DWORD = 0, this is not a finding.
</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
