					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Set the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft PowerPoint 2016 -&gt; PowerPoint Options -&gt; Security -&gt; Trust Center -&gt; Protected View "Open files on local Intranet UNC in Protected View" is set to "Enabled".  </ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
