				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Allows users to import Shortcuts from another browser into Microsoft Edge.

If this policy is disabled, Shortcuts are not imported on first run.

If this policy is not configured, Shortcuts are imported on first run.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
