				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Enables the Microsoft Edge AutoFill feature and lets users auto complete credit card information in web forms using previously stored information.

If this policy is disabled, AutoFill never suggests or fills credit card information, nor will it save additional credit card information that users might submit while browsing the web.

If this policy is enabled or not configured, users can control AutoFill for credit cards.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
