					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Extensions that are approved for use must be allowlisted if used.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>By default, all extensions are allowed. However, if all extensions are blocked by setting the "ExtensionInstallBlockList" policy to "*," users can only install extensions defined in this policy.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
