				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Microsoft Edge uses the Edge Feedback feature (enabled by default) to allow users to send feedback, suggestions, or customer surveys and to report any issues with the browser. By default, users cannot disable (turn off) the Edge Feedback feature.

If this policy is enabled or not configured, users can invoke Edge Feedback.

If this policy is disabled, users cannot invoke Edge Feedback.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
