					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>This setting allows users to access the Collections feature, where they can collect, organize, share, and export content more efficiently and with Office integration.

If this policy is enabled or not configured, users can access and use the Collections feature in Microsoft Edge.

If this policy is disabled, users cannot access and use Collections in Microsoft Edge.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
