				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Users must be required to restart the browser to finish installation of pending updates and prevent users from continually using an old/vulnerable browser version.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
