					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Set the policy value for "Computer Configuration/Administrative Templates/Microsoft Edge/Notify a user that a browser restart is recommended or required for pending updates" web-browsing activity to "Required".</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
