					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>This policy setting allows you to determine if Excel files in Outlook attachments open in Protected View. If you enable this policy setting, Outlook attachments do not open in Protected View. If you disable or do not configure this policy setting, Outlook attachments open in Protected View.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
