					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Content hosted on sites located in the Internet zone are likely to contain malicious payloads and therefore this feature should be blocked for this zone. Drag and drop or copy and paste files must have a level of protection based upon the site being accessed.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
