					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft Office 2016 -&gt; Security Settings "Encrypt document properties" is set to "Enabled". 

Procedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: 

HKCU\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Office\16.0\common\security

Criteria: If the value EncryptDocProps is REG_DWORD = 1, this is not a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Set the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft Office 2016 -&gt; Security Settings "Encrypt document properties" to "Enabled".
</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
