					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft Office 2016 -&gt; Present Online -&gt; "Remove Office Presentation Service from the list of online presentation services in PowerPoint and Word" is set to "Enabled".

Procedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: 

HKCU\software\policies\Microsoft\office\16.0\common\broadcast 

Criteria: If the value disabledefaultservice is REG_DWORD = 1, this is not a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Set the policy value for User Configuration -&gt; Administrative Templates -&gt; Microsoft Office 2016 -&gt; Present Online -&gt; "Remove Office Presentation Service from the list of online presentation services in PowerPoint and Word" to "Enabled".
</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
