					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Determine if a host-based firewall is installed and enabled on the system.  If a host-based firewall is not installed and enabled on the system, this is a finding.

The configuration requirements will be determined by the applicable firewall STIG.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
