					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The system must be configured to prevent Internet Control Message Protocol (ICMP) redirects from overriding Open Shortest Path First (OSPF) generated routes.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Allowing ICMP redirect of routes can lead to traffic not being routed properly.   When disabled, this forces ICMP to be routed via shortest path first.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
