					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>When the WDigest Authentication protocol is enabled, plain text passwords are stored in the Local Security Authority Subsystem Service (LSASS) exposing them to theft.  WDigest is disabled by default in Windows 10.  This setting ensures this is enforced.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
