Registry Path:  \SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\PassportForWork\PINComplexity\

Value Name:  MinimumPINLength

Type:  REG_DWORD
Value:  6 (or greater)</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; System &gt;&gt; PIN Complexity &gt;&gt; "Minimum PIN length" to "6" or greater. 

