					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The built-in administrator account is a well-known account subject to attack.  It also provides no accountability to individual administrators on a system.  It must be disabled to prevent its use.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
