					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Kerberos encryption types must be configured to prevent the use of DES and RC4 encryption suites.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Certain encryption types are no longer considered secure.  This setting configures a minimum encryption type for Kerberos, preventing the use of the DES and RC4 encryption suites.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>IA_Controls</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA></ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
