					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>If the following local computer policy is not configured as specified, this is a finding:
User Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Windows Copilot &gt;&gt; "Turn off Windows Copilot" to "Enabled".</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
